<title>UK: LPC-Russia's Bank Imperial in $50 mln loan.</title>
<headline>LPC-Russia's Bank Imperial in $50 mln loan.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, March 14 (LPC) - Russia's Bank Imperial have mandated London Forfaiting Asia to arrange a new $50 million credit, according to a banker close to the deal.</p>
<p>The two-year credit is priced at 387.5 bps over LIBOR. Syndication is scheduled to launch at the end of March.</p>
<p>In February, Imperial signed a $25 million credit which was arranged by Bank Austria. That one-year loan is priced at 387.5 bps over LIBOR.</p>
<p>Sophy Tonder 44-0171-542-4048</p>
</text>
